on, operator's keypad, stainless steel load receptor, level indicator, operator and customer display. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device, zero indicator, net indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing device, gravity compensation; check weighing and weighing unstable samples modes (SW-1S, SW-1C, SW-1W, SW-1LR, SW-1WR, ER JR, PW-II and ED models only). Any compatible CE-marked mains adaptor may be used. Sealing: access to the load cell and calibration switch is prevented by sealing the enclosure using a wire-and-seal or tamper-evident sticker.\"\n  },\n  \"model_family\": {\n    \"family_name\": \"SW Series\",\n    \"models\": [\n      {\"model_id\": \"ED single-interval Max=3kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ED single-interval Max=6kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ED single-interval Max=15kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ED single-interval Max=30kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ER PLUS / ER PLUS M single-interval Max=6kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ER PLUS / ER PLUS M single-interval Max=15kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ER PLUS / ER PLUS M single-interval Max=30kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SW-1S/SW-1C/SW-1W/SW-1LR/SW-1WR single-interval Max=2kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SW-1S/SW-1C/SW-1W/SW-1LR/SW-1WR single-interval Max=3kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SW-1S/SW-1C/SW-1W/SW-1LR/SW-1WR single-interval Max=5kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SW-1S/SW-1C/SW-1W/SW-1LR/SW-1WR single-interval Max=6kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SW-1S/SW-1C/SW-1W/SW-1LR/SW-1WR single-interval Max=10kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SW-1S/SW-1C/SW-1W/SW-1LR/SW-1WR single-interval Max=15kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SW-1S/SW-1C/SW-1W/SW-1LR/SW-1WR single-interval Max=20kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SW-1S/SW-1C/SW-1W/SW-1LR/SW-1WR single-interval Max=30kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ER JR single-interval Max=2kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ER JR single-interval Max=5kg\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"ER JR single-interval Max=10kg\"},\n  